Version: 0.1.0
Section: terminal
Architecture: aarch64
Maintainer: opencode-android <maintainer@example.com>
Depends: nodejs, python
Description: OpenCode - AI Coding Agent for Termux
 OpenCode runs as a terminal-based coding agent inside Termux.
 Provides AI-powered coding assistance with multiple model support.
 Requires nodejs and python from Termux packages.
 Run: opencode [command]
